{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"function useIsFetching(filters?: Accessor<QueryFilters<readonly unknown[]>>, queryClient?: Accessor<QueryClient>): Accessor<number>;","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/solid-query/src/useIsFetching.ts#L27","children":[{"type":"text","value":"packages/solid-query/src/useIsFetching.ts:27"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useIsFetching"},{"type":"text","value":" primitive returns the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"},{"type":"text","value":" of the queries that your application is loading or fetching\nin the background (useful for app-wide loading indicators)."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"parameters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Parameters"}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"filters","children":[{"type":"text","value":"filters?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Accessor"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/QueryFilters.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryFilters"}]},{"type":"text","value":"<readonly "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"unknown"},{"type":"text","value":"[]>>"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An accessor returning the "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/QueryFilters.md","children":[{"type":"text","value":"QueryFilters"}]},{"type":"text","value":" to narrow down the matched queries."}]},{"type":"html","value":"<a id=\"filters-properties\"></a>"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"id":"filters-properties","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"filters"},{"type":"text","value":" properties"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Built from "},{"type":"link","href":"../interfaces/QueryFilters.md#properties","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryFilters"}]},{"type":"text","value":". See the type above for what it changes."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"queryclient","children":[{"type":"text","value":"queryClient?"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Accessor"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"link","href":"../classes/QueryClient.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClient"}]},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An accessor for a custom "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"QueryClient"},{"type":"text","value":". Otherwise, the one from the nearest context\nwill be used."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"returns","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Returns"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Accessor"},{"type":"text","value":"<"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"},{"type":"text","value":">"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"An accessor for the "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"number"},{"type":"text","value":" of the queries that your application is currently loading or fetching\nin the background."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"import { useIsFetching } from '@tanstack/solid-query'\n\nfunction GlobalLoadingIndicator() {\n  // How many queries matching the posts prefix are fetching?\n  const isFetchingPosts = useIsFetching(() => ({ queryKey: ['posts'] }))\n\n  return isFetchingPosts() > 0 ? <span>Loading posts...</span> : null\n}","lang":"tsx"}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"filters","text":"filters?","level":3},{"id":"filters-properties","text":"filters properties","level":4},{"id":"queryclient","text":"queryClient?","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2},{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction useIsFetching(filters?: Accessor<QueryFilters<readonly unknown[]>>, queryClient?: Accessor<QueryClient>): Accessor<number>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/solid-query/src/useIsFetching.ts:27](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/solid-query/src/useIsFetching.ts#L27)\n\nThe `useIsFetching` primitive returns the `number` of the queries that your application is loading or fetching\nin the background (useful for app-wide loading indicators).\n\n## Parameters\n\n### filters?\n\n`Accessor`\\<[`QueryFilters`](../interfaces/QueryFilters.md)\\<readonly `unknown`[]\\>\\>\n\nAn accessor returning the [QueryFilters](../interfaces/QueryFilters.md) to narrow down the matched queries.\n\n<a id=\"filters-properties\"></a>\n\n#### `filters` properties\n\nBuilt from [`QueryFilters`](../interfaces/QueryFilters.md#properties). See the type above for what it changes.\n\n### queryClient?\n\n`Accessor`\\<[`QueryClient`](../classes/QueryClient.md)\\>\n\nAn accessor for a custom `QueryClient`. Otherwise, the one from the nearest context\nwill be used.\n\n## Returns\n\n`Accessor`\\<`number`\\>\n\nAn accessor for the `number` of the queries that your application is currently loading or fetching\nin the background.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nimport { useIsFetching } from '@tanstack/solid-query'\n\nfunction GlobalLoadingIndicator() {\n  // How many queries matching the posts prefix are fetching?\n  const isFetchingPosts = useIsFetching(() => ({ queryKey: ['posts'] }))\n\n  return isFetchingPosts() > 0 ? <span>Loading posts...</span> : null\n}\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: useIsFetching\ntitle: useIsFetching\nredirect_from:\n  - framework/solid/reference/useIsFetching\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction useIsFetching(filters?: Accessor<QueryFilters<readonly unknown[]>>, queryClient?: Accessor<QueryClient>): Accessor<number>;\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/solid-query/src/useIsFetching.ts:27](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/solid-query/src/useIsFetching.ts#L27)\n\nThe `useIsFetching` primitive returns the `number` of the queries that your application is loading or fetching\nin the background (useful for app-wide loading indicators).\n\n## Parameters\n\n### filters?\n\n`Accessor`\\<[`QueryFilters`](../interfaces/QueryFilters.md)\\<readonly `unknown`[]\\>\\>\n\nAn accessor returning the [QueryFilters](../interfaces/QueryFilters.md) to narrow down the matched queries.\n\n<a id=\"filters-properties\"></a>\n\n#### `filters` properties\n\nBuilt from [`QueryFilters`](../interfaces/QueryFilters.md#properties). See the type above for what it changes.\n\n### queryClient?\n\n`Accessor`\\<[`QueryClient`](../classes/QueryClient.md)\\>\n\nAn accessor for a custom `QueryClient`. Otherwise, the one from the nearest context\nwill be used.\n\n## Returns\n\n`Accessor`\\<`number`\\>\n\nAn accessor for the `number` of the queries that your application is currently loading or fetching\nin the background.\n\n## Example\n\n```tsx\nimport { useIsFetching } from '@tanstack/solid-query'\n\nfunction GlobalLoadingIndicator() {\n  // How many queries matching the posts prefix are fetching?\n  const isFetchingPosts = useIsFetching(() => ({ queryKey: ['posts'] }))\n\n  return isFetchingPosts() > 0 ? <span>Loading posts...</span> : null\n}\n```\n"}
